{"step_index":1736,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:57:32Z","input_tokens":245849,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1973,"thinking":"Determining the target goal and baseline values depends on the `marketCategory`. The ternary operators establish specific values if the category is 'BYBIT_TESTNET' or 'PROP_FIRM'; otherwise, default values are used. The `progressPercent` calculation then uses these dynamically determined `targetGoal` and `baseline` values to determine the balance progress.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update BalanceCards.tsx to accurately show $15 micro balance and $45 target","EndLine":60,"Instruction":"Update Bybit balance baseline and target in BalanceCards.tsx","ReplacementContent":"  const isBybit = marketCategory === 'BYBIT_TESTNET';\n  const isPropFirm = marketCategory === 'PROP_FIRM';\n  const targetGoal = isBybit ? 45.00 : (isPropFirm ? 53000 : 5739);\n  const baseline = isBybit ? 0 : (isPropFirm ? 48000 : 0);\n  const progressPercent = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ((balance - baseline) / Math.max(1, targetGoal - baseline)) * 100));\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n      {/* 1. BALANCE CARD */}\n      <div className=\"cyber-card p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase\">\n          <span>{isBybit ? 'Bybit Real-Tick Capital' : (isPropFirm ? 'Topstep Account Balance' : 'Crypto Balance')}</span>\n          <span className=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 font-mono font-bold\">\n            {isBybit ? '$15 MICRO LIVE' : (isPropFirm ? '$50K CHALLENGE' : '$42 START')}\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"my-2\">\n          <div className=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-wh