{"step_index":1758,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:00:56Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. yup do it. also i want a little big visual agent avatars with satisfying visuals of they working. adjust now\n2. okay now?\n3. 2\n4. so now what it shows is real trades profits losses and real data?\n5. imagine the bybit demo is real money i actually invested on this, so now the profit it shows is the real profit i get from this?\n6. i dont get it. i wanted everything to be real except for the money.\n7. like you said if i lose 150$ it will show that loss is 150$ right?\n8. also can we set it to start from 15 dollars?\n9. so now this can count as real life implementations without any fake details only except real money?\n10. buid it in agency mode\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: Build the **$15 Real-Tick Bybit Forward Execution Engine** in **Agency Mode**:\n  - Eliminate synthetic `Math.random()` simulation ticks and dice rolls.\n  - Set starting bankroll to **$15.00** (matching user's actual personal capital).\n  - Real micro-contract execution on live Bybit V5 Linear Perps (e.g. 0.001 BTC on 10x leverage, ~$8.20 margin).\n  - Live position lifecycle: opens on real Bybit order book skew, updates unrealized P&L tick-by-tick from Bybit's WebSocket, and closes **only** when Bybit's physical price reaches Stop Loss or Take Profit (or manual market close).\n  - Deducts real Bybit taker fees (0.055%).\n- **Constraints & Context**:\n  - Pure \\$0 real financial risk: paper execution mirroring real-market physics.\n  - Strictly follow Agency Mode protocol, Ponytail/Caveman (<3 lines of prose, code-first), and the 4-stage website lifecycle.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Architecture & Conclave (Blueprint)**: Completed.\n  - Decision logged to [`~/.gemini/decisions/raw/2026-10-20-15-dollar-real-tick-engine.md`](file:///Users/dev/.gemini/decisions/raw/2026-10-20-15-dollar-real-tick-engine.md).\n  - State tracked via `work_state_write` list `15-dollar-real-tick-engine`.\n- **Core Types & Constants**: Completed.\n  - Added `LivePosition` interface to [`src/types.ts`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/types.ts).\n  - Added `BYBIT_STARTING_BALANCE = 15.00`, `BYBIT_PROFIT_TARGET = 45.00` to [`src/engine/simulationData.ts`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/engine/simulationData.ts).\n- **Live Position HUD Component (Pixel)**: Completed.\n  - Built [`src/components/ActivePositionHUD.tsx`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/components/ActivePositionHUD.tsx):\n    - When scanning: Radar status card showing live Bybit L2 bid/ask skew and WebSocket status.\n    - When position open: Dynamic card showing instrument, Long/Short 10x badge, real-time unrealized P&L in \\$ and %, entry vs live Bybit price, visual SL/TP progress slider, margin/fee breakdown, and manual \"Close Position\" button.\n- **Engine Logic & WebSocket Hook (Forge)**: Completed.\n  - In [`src/engine/useTradingSimulation.ts`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/engine/useTradingSimulation.ts):\n    - Set default `BYBIT_TESTNET_STARTING_BALANCE = 15.00`.\n    - Added `activePosition` state and `livePositionRef`.\n    - Real-tick WebSocket evaluation: calculates `(livePrice - entryPrice) * sizeContracts - takerFee` on every incoming tick from `bybitFeed`.\n    - Real exit detection: triggers realized P&L when physical Bybit price touches SL (-0.25%, ~$0.25 loss) or TP (+0.6%, ~$0.49 win).\n    - Added `closeActivePositionManually()` for immediate market exits.\n- **UI Layout & Sizing**: Completed.\n  - Updated [`src/components/BalanceCards.tsx`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/components/BalanceCards.tsx): Card 1 shows `$15 MICRO LIVE`, target `3x Milestone: $45.00`, Card 3 shows `10x Leverage (~$8.20)`.\n  - Updated [`src/App.tsx`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/App.tsx): Rendered `ActivePositionHUD`.\n  - Updated [`public/_headers`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/public/_headers): Added `wss://stream-testnet.bybit.com` to CSP `connect-src`.\n- **Build & Code Audit**:\n  - `bun run build`: Built production bundle with zero errors.\n  - `vibe-audit code`: Grade A (100/100).\n- **Deployment (Shield)**:\n  - Deployed to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler: `task-1752` exited with code 0.\n  - Deployment URL: `https://c179d780.grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` / `https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **No Synthetic Dice Rolls**: In previous versions, trades were simulated via `Math.random()`. In this new engine, trades enter based on real Bybit order book imbalance ($\\ge 0.15$) and exit **strictly on physical price touch** of Take Profit or Stop Loss, giving genuine forward-testing validity.\n- **Micro-Position Math**: For a \\$15 account, trading 0.001 BTC on 10x leverage requires \\$8.20 margin and risks \\$0.25 on a \\$205 BTC price move, perfectly fitting within the bankroll.\n- **WebSocket CSP**: Cloudflare Pages `_headers` must explicitly declare `connect-src 'self' wss://stream-testnet.bybit.com wss://stream.bybit.com https://api-testnet.bybit.com https://api.bybit.com;` to avoid browser WebSocket blocking.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Working Directory**: `/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard`\n- **Live Production URL**: `https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev`\n- **Latest Deployment**: `https://c179d780.grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` (Task `task-1752` completed)\n- **Pending verification**: Need to run `vibe-audit url https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` to verify live site security grade, update companion HUD to completed, and provide final report.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (Immediate Resumption Priority)\n1. **Live URL Security Verification**:\n   - Run `/Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/bin/vibe-audit url https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` to verify live Grade A.\n2. **Companion HUD & Work State Update**:\n   - Run:\n     `python3 /Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/heyclicky-companion/set_agent_status.py Forge completed \"$15 Real-Tick Bybit Engine deployed & active\"`\n     `python3 /Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/heyclicky-companion/set_agent_status.py Shield completed \"Live security audit verified A (100/100)\"`\n   - Update `claude-mem` `work_state_write`: mark task as `done`.\n3. **User Presentation**:\n   - Emit concise completion summary with live URL, explaining how to watch the real-time position HUD and compounding balance.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero Real Money Risk**: Bankroll is \\$15.00 paper capital, while market data, entries, exits, fees, and price fluctuations are 100% real.\n- **Ponytail/Caveman Rules**: Terse output, <=3 lines of prose, bullet/code first, clickable file/URL links.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4]\nPath: file:///Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.user_uploaded/media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-19T08:39:49Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\nStart with the compact transcript; if a step has `truncated_fields`, read only that specific line in `transcript_full.jsonl`:\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl`\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript_full.jsonl`"}
